<!-- What We Offer -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Our Plasterboard Installation Services</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Plasterboard is the foundation of modern drylining. At <strong>Drylining Maidstone</strong>, we provide expert plasterboard installation for walls, ceilings, and custom features in residential, commercial, and industrial properties across Maidstone and the North West.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>Standard wall and ceiling plasterboard installation</li>
  <li>Moisture-resistant boards for bathrooms and kitchens</li>
  <li>Fire-rated plasterboard (30–120 minutes)</li>
  <li>Acoustic plasterboard for sound insulation</li>
  <li>Tapered edge and square edge options</li>
  <li>Insulated plasterboard for thermal efficiency</li>
  <li>Dot and dab direct-to-brick applications</li>
  <li>Timber and metal stud framing for board fixing</li>
</ul>

<!-- Why Choose Us -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Our Plasterboard Installation?</h2>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Precision cutting and fitting:</strong> Our team measures and cuts every board with accuracy, ensuring tight joints and a flawless finish around sockets, pipes, and fixtures.</li>
  <li><strong>Minimal disruption:</strong> We work cleanly and efficiently, using dust extraction and protective measures to keep your property tidy throughout the installation.</li>
  <li><strong>Board expertise:</strong> We help you choose the right board type for each room, from moisture-resistant bathrooms to fire-rated corridors and acoustic bedrooms.</li>
  <li><strong>Complete service:</strong> From framing to finishing, we handle every stage including stud work, board fixing, taping, jointing, and final sanding.</li>
  <li><strong>12-month guarantee:</strong> All our plasterboard installations are backed by a workmanship guarantee for your peace of mind.</li>
</ul>

<!-- Materials -->
<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Materials & Specifications</h2>
<p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">We use industry-leading plasterboard products to ensure durability, compliance, and a premium finish.</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li>British Gypsum Gyproc plasterboard (standard, moisture-resistant, fire-rated, soundbloc)</li>
  <li>Knauf plasterboard and jointing systems</li>
  <li>Metal C-studs and U-tracks (50mm, 70mm, 92mm profiles)</li>
  <li>Gyproc drywall adhesive for dot and dab applications</li>
  <li>Joint compound, paper tape, and scrim tape</li>
  <li>Insulation-backed plasterboard (Celotex, Kingspan, Rockwool)</li>
  <li>Fire-rated intumescent sealants and cavity barriers</li>
  <li>Moisture-resistant boards for wet areas</li>
</ul>

<!-- Applications -->
