  <li><strong>Professional Installation:</strong> Our CSCS-registered team measures, cuts, and fixes boards with precision, working cleanly and efficiently.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Check & Handover:</strong> We inspect every joint and surface, ensure compliance, and leave your space ready for decoration.</li>
</ol>

